# Ignore raw datasets and large data files
**/data/
**/landing/
**/reference/
**/processed/
**/rejected/
**/analytics/
**/curated/
**/_temporary/
**/spark_warehouse/
**/sp*_output/
**/output/
**/*.csv
**/*.CSV
**/*.parquet
**/*.orc
**/*.avro
**/*.gz
**/*.zip

# Ignore Spark-generated metadata and temp artifacts
**/_SUCCESS
**/*.crc
**/*.tmp
**/*.log

# Keep the source code and project config tracked
!**/*.py
!**/*.ipynb
!**/*.sql
!**/*.md
!**/*.yml
!**/*.yaml
!**/*.json
!**/*.toml
!**/*.ini
!**/*.cfg
!**/*.txt
!**/.gitignore

# Python cache and local databases
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.db
**/*.db
